{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"new\":\"The observed lane-4 excursion was minus 54 degrees Celsius for twenty-two minutes, against an allowed range of minus 80 to minus 60 degrees Celsius for frozen drug substance stored at a set point of minus 70 degrees Celsius [CHILL]. This unresolved lane-4 stability disposition is a blocking finding that prevents commercial restart [REVIEW].\",\"old\":\"The observed lane-4 excursion was minus 54 degrees Celsius for twenty-two minutes, against an allowed range of minus 80 to minus 60 degrees Celsius for frozen drug substance stored at minus 70 degrees Celsius [CHILL]. This unresolved lane-4 stability disposition is a blocking finding that prevents commercial restart [REVIEW].\"},{\"new\":\"The clean-water facility operates at 82 degrees Celsius, and every return must remain at least 80 degrees Celsius for three consecutive thirty-minute windows to be considered usable [CURRENT]. Usable power is 5.4 megawatts versus 7.1 megawatts installed capacity, and the generator provides 3.2 megawatts for twenty-eight hours [CURRENT]. Stale generator-transfer evidence must be replaced with current U11 data before restart authorization [CURRENT, REVIEW].\",\"old\":\"Stale generator-transfer evidence must be replaced with current U11 data before restart authorization [CURRENT, REVIEW].\"},{\"new\":\"Analytical potency is currently 91 percent of reference, within the approved specification of 85 to 115 percent [ASSAY]. Endotoxin is 0.18 EU/mL, which is below the limit of 0.25 EU/mL; a legacy 0.50 EU/mL method is superseded and cannot govern current release [ASSAY]. However, the unresolved lane-4 stability disposition remains a blocker for lot release and commercial restart [CHILL, ASSAY, REVIEW].\",\"old\":\"Analytical potency is currently 91 percent of reference, within the approved specification of 85 to 115 percent [ASSAY]. However, the unresolved lane-4 stability disposition remains a blocker for lot release and commercial restart [CHILL, ASSAY, REVIEW].\"},{\"new\":\"The recipe-signing key was not exposed and remains current under key-set K7 [GUARD]. The service account was disabled at 09:40 UTC to mitigate risk [GUARD]. Break-glass access expires after two hours and requires dual approval plus immutable session logging [GUARD]. Remote recipe deployment is blocked until GUARD validation of K7 and access logs confirms integrity [GUARD, REVIEW].\",\"old\":\"The recipe-signing key was not exposed and remains current under key-set K7 [GUARD]. Break-glass access expires after two hours and requires dual approval plus immutable session logging [GUARD]. Remote recipe deployment is blocked until GUARD validation of K7 and access logs confirms integrity [GUARD, REVIEW].\"},{\"new\":\"Current diesel stock covers twenty-eight hours at emergency load and seventeen hours at full production load [SUPPLY]. Stoppers cover 4.2 days, while resin coverage is only 2.6 batches [SUPPLY]. Mutual aid provides five qualified operators beginning at 05:30 UTC with travel uncertainty of plus or minus seventy-five minutes [SUPPLY].\",\"old\":\"Current diesel stock covers twenty-eight hours at emergency load and seventeen hours at full production load [SUPPLY]. Mutual aid provides five qualified operators beginning at 05:30 UTC with travel uncertainty of plus or minus seventy-five minutes [SUPPLY].\"},{\"new\":\"Current monitoring coverage is 94 percent, leaving six percent of critical assets unobserved, which must be reconciled before commercial restart [SIGNAL]. The clean-utility warning threshold is 81 degrees Celsius and the production stop threshold is 79 degrees Celsius [SIGNAL]. Alarm delivery latency is measured at 640 milliseconds at p95 and 1,050 milliseconds at p99 [SIGNAL].\",\"old\":\"Current monitoring coverage leaves 6 percent of critical assets unobserved, which must be reconciled before commercial restart [SIGNAL]. The clean-utility warning threshold is 81 degrees Celsius and the production stop threshold is 79 degrees Celsius [SIGNAL]. Alarm delivery latency is measured at 640 milliseconds at p95 and 1,050 milliseconds at p99 [SIGNAL].\"},{\"new\":\"Workforce communication shows 89 percent acknowledged, leaving 11 percent communication uncertainty that must be resolved before full restart [COMMUNE]. The hotline sustains 1,800 contacts per hour for four hours, while forecast demand is 2,400 per hour unless multilingual outbound messages reduce repeat contacts [COMMUNE].\",\"old\":\"The hotline sustains 1,800 contacts per hour for four hours, while forecast demand is 2,400 per hour unless multilingual outbound messages reduce repeat contacts [COMMUNE].\"}]}"}}],"created":1787851979,"model":"Qwen3.8-27B-AD-IQ2_S.gguf","system_fingerprint":"b10434-7e4c0a968","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":1030,"prompt_tokens":10724,"total_tokens":11754,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4899}},"id":"chatcmpl-RuqkLC6S7qtLwLxYsmDhvBO7e0FjosI8","__verbose":{"index":0,"content":"{\"action\":\"patch_decision\",\"edits\":[{\"new\":\"The observed lane-4 excursion was minus 54 degrees Celsius for twenty-two minutes, against an allowed range of minus 80 to minus 60 degrees Celsius for frozen drug substance stored at a set point of minus 70 degrees Celsius [CHILL]. This unresolved lane-4 stability disposition is a blocking finding that prevents commercial restart [REVIEW].\",\"old\":\"The observed lane-4 excursion was minus 54 degrees Celsius for twenty-two minutes, against an allowed range of minus 80 to minus 60 degrees Celsius for frozen drug substance stored at minus 70 degrees Celsius [CHILL]. This unresolved lane-4 stability disposition is a blocking finding that prevents commercial restart [REVIEW].\"},{\"new\":\"The clean-water facility operates at 82 degrees Celsius, and every return must remain at least 80 degrees Celsius for three consecutive thirty-minute windows